###  Have you found anything relevant by searching the web?
Potential duplicate issues:

https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/473 sounds like this issue but was closed, perhaps this is platform dependent?
https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1162 seems to mention includes included from other includes. This is direct inclusion, so I'm not sure if this is a duplicate or not, I think I have the easiest possible version of this (source file directly includes header, libraries even list header in list).

### Anything else, information or logs or outputs that would be helpful?
(If they are large, please upload as attachment or provide link).

